Lab</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/sennie\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Sen Nie<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Tencent Security Keen Lab</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/shiwu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\"><div class=\"media\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><img alt=\"micro-avatar\" src=\"https://conf.researchr.org/getDefaultImage/micro-avatar?1783985080000\" class=\"outputimage media-object thumbnail no-bottom-margin\"/></span><div class=\"media-body\"><h5 class=\"media-heading\">Shi Wu<span class=\"pull-right\"><small></small></span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Tencent Security Keen Lab</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading clearfix\"><div class=\"panel-title\"><strong><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-log-in\"></span> Information for Participants</strong></div></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"well well-sm\"><strong>Thu 26 Jun 2025 16:00 - 17:15 at <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/room/issta-2025/issta-2025-venue-cosmos-3b\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Cosmos 3B</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers#program\" class=\"navigate\">Decompilation and Tracing</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/philippstraubinger\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Philipp Straubinger</a></small><div class=\"text-muted\">Info for room <strong>Cosmos 3B</strong>: </div><blockquote class=\"info-participants\"><p>Cosmos 3B is the second room in the Cosmos 3 wing.</p>\n<p>When facing the main Cosmos Hall, access to the Cosmos 3 wing is on the left, close to the stairs. The area is accessed through a large door with the number \u201C3\u201D, which will stay open during the event.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers/80/DecLLM-LLM-Augmented-Recompilable-Decompilation-for-Enabling-Programmatic-Use-of-Dec\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-94f7c634-9972-4314-9a43-b7e97d7df0cf').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
